UID:2027-02-21-race-race-day-half-marath@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270221T080000
DTEND:20270221T090000
SUMMARY:[RW] RACE DAY: Half marathon
DESCRIPTION:Start easier than feels necessary for the first third. Eat and
  drink as practised\, nothing new. It is a day to enjoy the work you did\
 ; no plan can promise a time.\n\nWeek 13 (RACE). Not medical advice\; pai
 n that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
